  "description": "LoadSurge - High-performance, dependency-free load testing framework for .NET. Open workload model (constant arrival rate) with zero-allocation hot path. Framework-agnostic core engine supporting any testing framework or standalone usage. Perfect for testing APIs, microservices, and distributed systems under load.",
